{"document_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48", "revision_track": "source-faithful", "version_id": "sha256:77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09:effective-2021年3月1日:revision-修订", "chunk_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:source-faithful:sha256:77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09:effective-2021年3月1日:revision-修订:chunk-0004", "chunk_order": 4, "corpus": "regulations", "collection": "institutional_regulations", "source_uri": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "source_chunk_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:row-0006", "anchor": {"section_path": ["二、采购注意事项", "（一）采购意向公示要求"]}, "text": "标题：中央民族大学采购工作管理办法 | 章节：二、采购注意事项 > （一）采购意向公示要求\n二、采购注意事项\n\n（一）采购意向公示要求\n\n1.为进一步提高政府采购透明度，优化政府采购营商环境，根据《关于开展政府采购意向公开工作的通知》（财库〔2020〕10号）要求，我校的政府采购货物、工程、服务项目（货物、服务单项或批量预算金额达到100万元及以上的；工程预算金额达到120万元及以上的），必须在项目采购活动开始（发布项目招标采购信息公告）前35日将采购意向公开文件（详见附件）发送至邮箱：201701028@muc.edu.cn。\n\n2.请各项目单位务必高度重视，加强采购活动的计划性，及时、全面公开采购意向，做到不遗漏、不延误，保证项目及预算执行进度。", "source_channel": "manual_curated", "is_current": false, "parser_version": "internal_notice_regulation_projection_preview_v1", "embedding_model": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B", "entitlement_groups": ["campus_members"], "visibility_scope": "campus", "visibility_level": "restricted", "policy_projection_version": "phase1-authorization-projection-v1", "canonical_url": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "latest_url": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "status": "active", "embedding": null, "sparse_indices": [], "sparse_values": [], "metadata": {"unit_type": "institutional_regulation_block", "root_unit_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:root", "segment_index": 1, "segment_total": 1, "split_reason": null, "boundary_rule": null, "strategy_name": "institutional_regulations_semantic_v1", "split_strategy": "structure_first", "chunk_policy_version