{"document_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48", "revision_track": "source-faithful", "version_id": "sha256:77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09:effective-2021年3月1日:revision-修订", "chunk_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:source-faithful:sha256:77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09:effective-2021年3月1日:revision-修订:chunk-0005", "chunk_order": 5, "corpus": "regulations", "collection": "institutional_regulations", "source_uri": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "source_chunk_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:row-0010", "anchor": {"section_path": ["二、采购注意事项", "（二）校内集中采购项目采购流程"]}, "text": "标题：中央民族大学采购工作管理办法 | 章节：二、采购注意事项 > （二）校内集中采购项目采购流程\n（二）校内集中采购项目采购流程\n\n1.采购意向公示：政府采购限额以上的项目提前35日向资产管理处（招标采购中心）提交采购意向公示书；\n\n2.填报采购申请：校内集中采购项目在服务门户的采购申请模块中填报采购需求；\n\n3.采购申请受理：资产管理处（招标采购中心）受理采购申请，组织采购。", "source_channel": "manual_curated", "is_current": false, "parser_version": "internal_notice_regulation_projection_preview_v1", "embedding_model": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B", "entitlement_groups": ["campus_members"], "visibility_scope": "campus", "visibility_level": "restricted", "policy_projection_version": "phase1-authorization-projection-v1", "canonical_url": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "latest_url": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "status": "active", "embedding": null, "sparse_indices": [], "sparse_values": [], "metadata": {"unit_type": "institutional_regulation_block", "root_unit_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:root", "segment_index": 1, "segment_total": 1, "split_reason": null, "boundary_rule": null, "strategy_name": "institutional_regulations_semantic_v1", "split_strategy": "structure_first", "chunk_policy_version": "institutional_regulations_semantic_v1", "cleaning_policy_version": "institutional_regulations_cleaning_v1", "title": "中央民族大学采购工作管理